      "## Club registration figures for 2020\\[ [edit](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_most_popular_dog_breeds_in_the_United_States&action=edit&section=9)\\]\n",
      "\n",
      "Club registration figures for 2020.[\\[13\\]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_most_popular_dog_breeds_in_the_United_States#cite_note-13)\n",
      "\n",
      "| Position | Breed |\n",
      "| --- | --- |\n",
      "| 1 | [Laborador Retriever](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labrador_Retriever) |\n",
      "| 2 | [French Bulldogs](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Bulldogs) |\n",
      "| 3 | [German Shepherd](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Shepherd) |\n",
      "| 4 | [Golden Retriever](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Retriever) |\n",
      "| 5 | [Bulldogs](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bulldog) |\n",
      "| 6 | [Poodles](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poodles) |\n",
      "| 7 | [Beagle](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beagle) |\n",
      "| 8 | [Rottweiler](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rottweiler) |\n",
      "| 9 | [German Shorthaired Pointer](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Shorthaired_Pointer) |\n",
      "| 10 | [Dachshund](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dachshund) |\n",
      "\n",
      "For the first time, the French Bulldog rose above the German Shepherd and Golden Retriever to land in the number 2 spot. The [Pembroke Welsh Corgi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pembroke_Welsh_Corgi) made number 11. The [Belgian Malinois](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belgian_Malinois) rose in popularity from number 60 to number 37. The lowest ranked breed of the year was the [Norwegian Lundehund](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwegian_Lundehund).\n",
      "\n",
      "## Club registration figures for 2021\\[ [edit](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=List_of_most_popular_dog_breeds_in_the_United_States&action=edit&section=10)\\]\n",
      "\n",
      "Club registration figures for 2021.[\\[14\\]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_most_popular_dog_breeds_in_the_United_States#cite_note-14)\n",
      "\n",
      "| Position | Breed |\n",
      "| --- | --- |\n",
      "| 1 | [Laborador Retriever](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labrador_Retriever) |\n",
      "| 2 | [French Bulldogs](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Bulldogs) |\n",
      "| 3 | [Golden Retriever](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Retriever) |\n",
      "| 4 | [German Shepherd](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Shepherd) |\n",
