      "| 10 | [Dachshund](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dachshund) |\n",
      "\n",
      "This was the 31st year of Labrador Retrievers being ranked number one. The Poodle jumped back into the top 5, the last time this occurred was in 1997. Another jump in popularity was the [Field Spaniel](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Field_Spaniel) gaining 24 places to land at number 136. The lowest ranked breed of the year was the [Norwegian Lundehund](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwegian_Lundehund).\n",
      "\n",
