      "\n",
      "- [![Chicago skyline](data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20300%20300'%3E%3C/svg%3E)**Chicago**](https://www.rover.com/blog/chicago-popular-pet-breeds/)\n",
      "\n",
