      "ID: https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/news/most-popular-dog-breeds-2023/\n",
      "Score: None\n",
      "Published Date: 2024-04-09T19:27:22.000Z\n",
      "Author: Melanie Haid\n",
      "Image: https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn-origin-etr.akc.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/19194159/French-Bulldog-sitting-on-the-couch-home-alone.jpeg\n",
      "Favicon: https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn-origin-etr.akc.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/03140341/favicon-32x32-1.png\n",
